<Policy title="Privacy policy" titleHi="गोपनीयता नीति" summaryHi="हम केवल वही जानकारी लेते हैं जो सेवा के लिए ज़रूरी है: फ़ोन नंबर, नाम (वैकल्पिक) और आपके टेस्ट के परिणाम। हम आपका डेटा बेचते नहीं हैं। व्हाट्सऐप संदेश केवल आपकी सहमति से, और STOP लिखकर कभी भी बंद।">
  <p>Effective date: [EFFECTIVE DATE]</p>
  <p>This policy explains what [BUSINESS NAME] ("we") collects through Prashnottar and how we use it.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Phone number and name</strong> when you ask for solutions or sets on WhatsApp, or create an account.</li>
    <li><strong>Test results</strong>: answers, score and topic-wise performance, so we can show reports and improve questions.</li>
    <li><strong>Chat messages</strong> you send to the "Ask" assistant, to answer you and improve replies.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment records</strong> from our payment partner (order id, amount, status). We never see or store card or UPI details.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic technical data</strong> such as device type and pages visited. If Meta Pixel is enabled, Meta receives events such as page views and sign-ups to measure our ads.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run the service: show your results, unlock packs, keep your account secure.</li>
    <li>To send WhatsApp messages you agreed to, such as the next practice set. Reply STOP to opt out at any time.</li>
    <li>To measure and improve our ads and content.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your data. We share it only with service providers that help us run Prashnottar (hosting, payments, WhatsApp messaging, ads measurement, the AI service behind the assistant), under their own privacy terms, or when the law requires it.</p>
  <h2>Storage and retention</h2>
  <p>Data is stored on servers we control or rent. We keep it while your account is active or as long as needed for the purposes above and our legal obligations. Your device also keeps your test progress and language choice in local storage.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete your data by writing to [SUPPORT EMAIL]. We reply within 30 days. This policy is written with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 in mind.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Grievance officer: [NAME], [BUSINESS NAME], [ADDRESS]. Email: [SUPPORT EMAIL].</p>
</Policy>
